{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_title", "source_sha256": "bebb4f0ce3b483cc1cb7a921f344e738c64e8aca8fccf382ff9e221888331928", "ja": "琴葉とおでかけ1", "zh": "和琴叶外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f555e51ce0eddcda7910c5e573b159b783e0bd6f3f343533048b011fc2700b6a", "ja": "琴葉とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和琴叶一起外出的那一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1a8aea4dd497d994820bc32acb0412dd67a82716965b7725a9e29dc1cb007765", "ja": "（今日は沖縄での握手会。普段、劇場に来られない\nファンの人達と、交流できる貴重な機会だ）", "zh": "（今天是在冲绳举办握手会。平时没法来到剧场的粉丝们，今天是与他们交流的宝贵机会）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4404688ea86cbf48213553b450de7cab9a9c41a60672f3ff6c1d1889e0b888f7", "ja": "……琴葉？\nそろそろ始まるけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "……琴叶？\n马上就要开始了，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "f6419ecdfa2d7f172c2a012d6dd1d22d3c6f62c016079cfaf4c955b874d5e7fc", "ja": "あっ……すみません、{$P$}。\n今、メモを見返していたんです。", "zh": "啊……抱歉，{$P$}。\n我刚才在重新看笔记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "f867d893da44fe40d116d616430b2c115bb9814bf95a3be3f05d70a8726e6218", "ja": "せっかく、ファンのみなさんと交流できるので……\n沖縄の言葉を、すこしでも覚えられたらと思って。", "zh": "难得有机会和各位粉丝交流……  \n我想着，要是能学会一点冲绳话就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "09155a69906236f1bdfa6998ea40aaea7fb2c3868cc41a34a82f49d3a710bbca", "ja": "そうなのか。\n……それにしても、すごい量だな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n……不过话说回来，量还真不少啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "01145b650b98516916ce34f505629d23db7e47d6d7e231d6688ac2b72a2a4cca", "ja": "そうですね。よく使いそうな言葉だけに\nしたつもりだったんですけど、気がついたら……。", "zh": "是啊。我本来只挑了些似乎经常会用到的词，可回过神来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "d3bb478314fc5e8e51e1f3cf35eb38c6aeafaae7b50ac55b2f93ad92c114a0cf", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}も、必要があれば\n言ってくださいね。すぐにお見せしますから。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生如果有需要，也请告诉我哦。我马上拿给您看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2b7f6ebae49cf0695fc4ce534ec3393ec05b5bc90f13d20a9720f388c2b14955", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！　琴葉が思ったより\nリラックスしてるみたいで、安心したよ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！琴叶好像比想象中更放松，让我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "fd2fa97d37f9205218fc78a7e3f8c347dd8b21d723dc00b68e6decbcc6be3dca", "ja": "はい。緊張は、もちろんしてますけど……今日を\n楽しみに来てくれた、ファンの人たちがいますから。", "zh": "是的。我当然也会紧张……但有些粉丝是怀着期待今天而来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth01_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "62fdc191f28e8f8c45e713988ac41e0e24410e65c95577127f68d7570cab3297", "ja": "その人たちに、「いつか劇場に行ってみたい」\n……って思ってもらえるように、がんばります♪", "zh": "我会努力让那些人产生“总有一天也想去剧场看看”的想法♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
